### Scout API — example requests
### Set @baseUrl to your backend. Run login first and copy the access_token.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@photoId = PASTE_PHOTO_ID_HERE

### Login as a regular user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "insect",
  "password": "insect123"
}

### Login as admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### List photos (no filter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/photos?limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List photos filtered by class + min confidence
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/photos?classId=thrips&minConfidence=0.7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Next page (use next_token from a previous response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/photos?limit=20&cursor=PASTE_NEXT_TOKEN
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get a single photo
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/photos/{{photoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a presigned upload link (admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/photos/{{photoId}}/upload-link
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentType": "image/jpeg"
}

### Check object existence (admin only, seeder idempotency)
HEAD {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/photos/{{photoId}}/object
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get a thumbnail (token via query so it also works in <img>)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/photos/{{photoId}}/thumbnail?width=640&dpr=2&quality=80&format=jpeg&token={{token}}

### Get the original image
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/photos/{{photoId}}/original?token={{token}}

### Health (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz

### Metrics (admin only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics?token={{token}}

### Debug vars (admin only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/debug/vars?token={{token}}
